    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d671">

                <pb facs="0675" n="559" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg559"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 365.117/282.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Page to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-06-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 8, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>318. Enrico Ajello, holder passport 51345 February this year, detained by
                    military authorities pending proof his father naturalized before his birth. His
                    brother Antonino lives 2433 First Avenue, New York. Can you verify and cable
                    Embassy?</p>
                <closer>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy.</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
